flowchart TD
 S["Pause Mark Start：阶段起点"] --> M["Concurrent Mark"]
 M --> E{"Pause Mark End：闭包完成？"}
 E -->|否| C["Concurrent Mark Continue"]
 C --> E
 E -->|是| F["Concurrent Mark Free"]
